{% from "govuk/components/table/macro.njk" import govukTable %}
{% from "govuk/components/inset-text/macro.njk" import govukInsetText %}

<div class="brel-section">
  <h2 class="govuk-heading-l brel-section-heading">
    How the dwelling meets the guidance
  </h2>

  <p class="govuk-body-m govuk-!-font-weight-bold">
    Elements are marked as:
  </p>

  {{ govukTable({
    firstCellIsHeader: true,
    rows: [
      [
        {
          html: '<span class="brel-guidance-tag brel-guidance-tag--meets"><span class="brel-guidance-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Meets guidance</span>'
        },
        { text: "This shows it is in line with the typical ranges and guidance in Approved Document L." }
      ],
      [
        {
          html: '<span class="brel-guidance-tag brel-guidance-tag--does-not-meet"><span class="brel-guidance-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>Does not meet guidance</span>'
        },
        { text: "This shows it is not in line with the typical ranges and guidance in Approved Document L. The designer or contractor should explain why the guidance has not been met." }
      ],
      [
        {
          html: '<span class="brel-guidance-tag brel-guidance-tag--unusual"><span class="brel-guidance-tag__icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>Performs unusually well</span>'
        },
        { text: "This shows it is unusually performant and may have been entered incorrectly. If it is correct, the designer or contractor should explain how it meets these performance values." }
      ]
    ]
  }) }}

  {% call govukInsetText() %}
    <strong>These do not all have to be green for the building to be compliant,</strong>
    but they should serve as a guide about what could be improved and what should be done to ensure the dwelling is energy efficient.
  {% endcall %}
</div>